/P 125 0 R
/E (Artificial Intelligence has become part of the academic activities of many students represented in this survey. Students reported using AI for a wide range of academic purposes, including understanding difficult concepts, solving academic problems, completing assignments, preparing for examinations, summarising study materials, conducting research, programming, improving written work, generating ideas, translation, and creating presentations. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
