>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 125 0 R
/E (Rather than treating AI use simply as a technological behaviour, the survey provides information about how students perceive its educational value and its potential disadvantages. Respondents expressed both positive and negative views. Some described AI as useful for learning and understanding difficult topics, whereas others highlighted its potential to reduce critical thinking, originality, independent thinking, and the habit of consulting traditional learning resources. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
